      "side": 1,
      "message": "TIL: Zephyr has some helper functions for doing arithmetic in Kconfig.  However, it doesn\u0027t appear to work directly from Kconfig options.\n\n```\nconfig PLATFORM_EC_PD_MAX_POWER_MW\n  int \"Max power\"\n  default $(mul,$(PLATFORM_EC_PD_MAX_CURRENT_MA),$(PLATFORM_EC_PD_MAX_VOLTAGE_MV))\n```\n\nBut creating variables does work.\n```\nMAX_MA :\u003d 3000\nMAX_MV :\u003d 20000\n\nconfig PLATFORM_EC_PD_MAX_POWER_MW\n\tint \"PD maximum power in milliwatt\"\n\tdefault $(div,$(mul,$(MAX_MA),$(MAX_MV)),1000)\n```",
